        desc: "Memberikan ketelitian posisi di lapangan hingga sekitar 0,11 meter.",
      },
      {
        title: "Kepatuhan OpenStreetMap:",
        desc: "Reverse geocoding menggunakan data terbuka dari kontributor OpenStreetMap di bawah lisensi ODbL.",
      },
    ],
    h2Independence: "3. Independensi Editorial",
    pIndependence:
      "MyLocationLab tidak menerima kompensasi berbayar untuk mempromosikan perangkat keras, aplikasi, atau layanan VPN tertentu.",
    h2Privacy: "4. Privasi Penuh di Sisi Klien",
    pPrivacy:
      "Koordinat Anda diproses murni di memori sementara peramban web dan tidak pernah disimpan atau dikirim ke peladen kami.",
    h2Corrections: "5. Protokol Pelaporan Koreksi",
    pCorrections:
      "Jika Anda menemukan kekeliruan perhitungan teknis atau informasi:",
    correctionSteps: [
      "Kirimkan laporan ke editorial@mylocationlab.com dengan menyertakan URL halaman terkait.",
      "Sertakan rincian kekeliruan dan sumber rujukan resmi (W3C, EPSG, atau institusi pemetaan).",
      "Dewan teknis kami meninjau laporan dalam waktu maksimal 48 jam kerja.",
    ],
  },
};

const c = policyContent[lang] || policyContent.en;
const homePath = lang === "en" ? "/" : `/${lang}/`;

const breadcrumbs = [
  { label: t("common.home"), href: homePath },
  { label: c.breadcrumb },
];

const pageUrl = getLocalizedPath("/editorial-policy/", lang);
const schemaData = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  name: c.h1,
  description: c.metaDesc,
  url: `https://mylocationlab.com${pageUrl}`,
  publisher: {
    "@type": "Organization",
    name: "MyLocationLab",
    url: "https://mylocationlab.com",
    logo: "https://mylocationlab.com/favicon.svg",
  },
};
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title={c.metaTitle}
  description={c.metaDesc}
  activeSection="editorial-policy"
  jsonLd={[schemaData]}
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} lang={lang} />

    <section
      class="page-header"
      style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: var(--space-8);"
    >
      <span class="badge badge-primary" style="margin-bottom: var(--space-3);"
        >{c.badge}</span
      >
      <h1>
        {c.h1.split("&")[0]}
        <span class="text-gradient">& {c.h1.split("&")[1] || ""}</span>
      </h1>
      <p
        class="page-header-desc"
        style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.75;"
      >
        {c.subtitle}
      </p>
    </section>

    <article
      class="prose"
      style="max-width: var(--max-width-narrow); margin: 0 auto var(--space-16); font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.8;"
    >
      <h2>{c.h2Board}</h2>
      <p>{c.pBoard}</p>
      <div
        style="display: grid; gap: var(--space-4); margin: var(--space-6) 0;"
      >
        {
          c.boardPoints.map((item) => (
            <div style="background: var(--color-bg-card); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);">
              <strong style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
                {item.title}
              </strong>
              <p style="margin: var(--space-1) 0 0; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm);">
                {item.desc}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <h2>{c.h2Standards}</h2>
      <p>{c.pStandards}</p>
      <ul>
        {
          c.standards.map((s) => (
            <li>
              <strong>{s.title}</strong> {s.desc}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>

      <h2>{c.h2Independence}</h2>
      <p>{c.pIndependence}</p>

      <h2>{c.h2Privacy}</h2>
      <p>{c.pPrivacy}</p>

      <h2>{c.h2Corrections}</h2>
      <p>{c.pCorrections}</p>
      <ol
        style="padding-left: var(--space-5); margin: var(--space-4) 0 var(--space-8);"
      >
        {
          c.correctionSteps.map((step) => (
            <li style="margin-bottom: var(--space-2); color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
              {step}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>

      <div
        style="margin-top: var(--space-10); padding: var(--space-6); background: var(--color-bg-secondary); border-radius: var(--radius-xl); border: 1px solid var(--color-border); text-align: center;"
      >
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; font-size: var(--text-lg); font-weight: 700;">
          Direct Editorial Inquiries
        </h3>
        <p
          style="color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-bottom: var(--space-4);"
        >
          Have a question for our review team or want to submit an academic
          correction?
        </p>
        <a
          href="mailto:editorial@mylocationlab.com"
          class="btn btn-primary"
          style="text-decoration: none;">editorial@mylocationlab.com</a
        >
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
